Hi Anika,

Yes. A custom field on the lot record does this, and it flows into the CSV export automatically.

- [ ] I add a text field "Spec reference" to your lot record today
- [ ] You set the default value to VC-QS-114 rev D §7.5 (Settings → Lot records → Fields); per-lot overrides are allowed
- [ ] The export picks it up as the last column from the next run

No lead time beyond today. I will send a screenshot once the field is live, by **Tuesday, March 3, 10:00 PT**, so you have two weeks before the auditors arrive on **March 16**.

Hana

